# PR Standard
> Standard: GitHub PRs

## Intent
Defines PR title, summary, checklist, and testing expectations.

## Rule
- Every PR should explain why the change exists, not only what changed.
- Include testing notes and any known gaps or follow-ups.
- Call out rollout or migration concerns before requesting review.

